    "updated_at": "2026-06-01T19:20:55Z",
    "body": "FWIW `appearance:auto` _does_ change the label based on element mutations (`data:text/html,<select><option id=o>One</option></select><script>setTimeout(() => o.textContent = 'Two',500)</script>`) in all browsers. \n\nRight now `data:text/html,<select><button><selectedcontent></selectedcontent></button><option id=o>One</option></select><script>setTimeout(() => o.textContent = 'Two',500)</script>` also changes the label, though I suppose #12474 will change that?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
