    "updated_at": "2026-06-01T22:37:43Z",
    "body": "Yeah, for appearance:auto we register a mutation observer on the selected option in chromium due to a web compat issue when the select element was migrated from a layout based thing to a dom based thing many years ago. There's another issue about that here: https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11766",
